  "design_notes": {
    "independence": "Face and object trust-level assignments within each CB group follow the same rotation pattern (high/low/neutral → low/neutral/high → neutral/high/low) but are conceptually independent — the social vs. non-social comparison is the key manipulation.",
    "fact_items_fixed": "Fact items (H1/F1, N1/O1, etc.) are fixed per stimulus ID across CB groups. Only the trust level rotates.",
    "object_facts": "Object domains: object_material (M1=Holz, M2=Metall, M3=Glas) and object_origin (O1=Japan, O2=Brasilien, O3=Kanada). Items fixed per object_id; see item_pool.json."
